WEBVTT
Kind: captions
Language: en

00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:02.357
- This is so weird, 'cause

00:00:02.357 --> 00:00:04.207
you know, when you're friends
and family with someone

00:00:04.207 --> 00:00:05.900
and you have 'em on
your show, it's awkward.

00:00:05.900 --> 00:00:07.480
I ended up marrying her oldest son,

00:00:07.480 --> 00:00:09.470
and you got stuck with me more.

00:00:09.470 --> 00:00:11.000
- Thank goodness.

00:00:11.000 --> 00:00:12.239
Thank goodness.

00:00:12.239 --> 00:00:13.072
(audience applauds)

00:00:13.072 --> 00:00:13.905
Yeah, I'll clap to that one, too.

00:00:13.905 --> 00:00:16.920
- But I mean, out of
all the fun we've had,

00:00:16.920 --> 00:00:18.990
I always have my little moments with you,

00:00:18.990 --> 00:00:21.280
because I know we're
friends and we're family,

00:00:21.280 --> 00:00:23.520
but you're always like that hero to me,

00:00:23.520 --> 00:00:24.660
especially musically,

00:00:24.660 --> 00:00:26.390
like, you're just a beast,

00:00:26.390 --> 00:00:27.980
like, a pioneer for women,

00:00:27.980 --> 00:00:30.150
like, it's insane.
- Thank you.

00:00:30.150 --> 00:00:31.800
- And not just musically.

00:00:31.800 --> 00:00:33.530
I think what's amazing
about your career is

00:00:33.530 --> 00:00:35.500
you're a businesswoman,

00:00:35.500 --> 00:00:37.420
you've conquered Broadway,

00:00:37.420 --> 00:00:38.590
you've conquered TV,

00:00:38.590 --> 00:00:40.130
you've conquered movies,

00:00:40.130 --> 00:00:41.040
animated film.

00:00:41.040 --> 00:00:43.530
I mean, you've done
everything you could possibly

00:00:43.530 --> 00:00:44.363
want to do.

00:00:44.363 --> 00:00:46.980
So my question is what
is the next mountain?

00:00:46.980 --> 00:00:48.120
Because

00:00:48.120 --> 00:00:51.320
you've already mastered everything.

00:00:51.320 --> 00:00:53.040
- Well, I haven't mastered
or conquered anything,

00:00:53.040 --> 00:00:53.900
I want y'all to know.
- Yes, you have.

00:00:53.900 --> 00:00:55.580
- I've just gotten to participate.

00:00:55.580 --> 00:00:58.080
People were nice enough
to let me be a part of.

00:00:58.080 --> 00:00:59.870
I tell you what I'd really love to do.

00:00:59.870 --> 00:01:00.703
- Okay.

00:01:00.703 --> 00:01:03.440
I want to do an authentic Western movie

00:01:03.440 --> 00:01:05.020
or a television show.

00:01:05.020 --> 00:01:05.853
A Western.

00:01:05.853 --> 00:01:08.790
- People would love that.
- I love Westerns.

00:01:08.790 --> 00:01:10.620
- Oh my God, there's so many avenues now.

00:01:10.620 --> 00:01:11.453
Netflix, Amazon,

00:01:11.453 --> 00:01:12.286
all the things.
- Everywhere.

00:01:12.286 --> 00:01:13.750
- We can make this happen.

00:01:13.750 --> 00:01:17.070
- Kelly Clarkson said so, right there.

00:01:17.070 --> 00:01:18.869
- I mean, I think people would love that.

00:01:18.869 --> 00:01:19.919
- I do too, I do too.

